  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoding and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727. These results suggest the multiprofile setting may improve RNA-only performance compared to the singleprofile baseline (llm_summary_002), though the role of avgpool aggregation and other design choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
